Spec: Ride title

Purpose:
  The title a ride shows everywhere.

Owns:
  ./ride_title.dart
  /test/domain/ride_title_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/04-domain.md

Must:
  A non-blank description is the title.
  Otherwise the title is the full localized date (`yMMMMEEEEd`) of the ride date, its start time or now.
  The title is never empty.
